# iCloud conflict copies. This repo lives under ~/Desktop, which macOS syncs to
# iCloud Drive, and iCloud resolves a sync conflict by writing a second file
# named "<name> 2.ext" beside the original. They are stale copies, never work.
#
# They are not merely untidy: a duplicate under .next/types declares the same
# global types twice and breaks `tsc` with "Duplicate identifier", and a copy of
# a source file is picked up by any tool that globs the tree.
#
# The durable fix is to move the repo out of ~/Desktop. Until then these are
# ignored here, excluded from tsc/vitest, and asserted absent by
# apps/web/src/lib/repo/__tests__/noConflictCopies.test.ts
# The space before the digit is load-bearing: without it these patterns would
# also swallow legitimate names like `layer2.ts` or `v2.json`.
* [0-9].*
* [0-9][0-9].*
